#import "release.typ": release, plain-words, signing
#show: release.with(
  title: "Photo, Video and Voice Release",
  intro: [*Thank you for helping us tell the Homestead's story!* This is the agreement between you and Sun Brewed Homestead Inc. ("the Homestead") about photos, video and recordings of you, or your child, at Homestead activities. Please read all of it, and ask a Steward about anything unclear before you sign. Below, "I" means you.],
)

#plain-words[
- We may photograph, film and record you at our activities and share it to support our mission, without paying you.
- You can change your mind at any time by telling us in writing. We'll stop using your photos in anything new and take down posts we control.
- Adults are named by first name only, and a child's full name, school or other identifying details are never published.
- We never sell your image, or let others use it in their own advertising.
]

*1. Permission.* I give the Homestead permission to photograph, film and record me (or my child) at Homestead activities, and to use, copy, edit and publish those photos, video and audio, together with my first name ("Media"), without payment to me. I waive any right to inspect or approve finished Media or the words used with it.

*2. How the Homestead will use Media.* The Homestead will use Media for its nonprofit mission: on its website and social media (for example Instagram, Facebook, Nextdoor and LinkedIn), in newsletters and emails, printed flyers and signs, presentations, and fundraising and grant materials (for example our Zeffy campaigns). It will identify adults by first name only unless I agree otherwise, and will never publish a minor's full name, school or other identifying details. It owns the Media it creates, and will never sell Media or license it to others for their own advertising.

*3. Changing my mind.* I may withdraw this permission at any time by writing to the Homestead. The Homestead will stop using my Media in new materials and will take down posts it controls within a reasonable time. It cannot recall printed materials already distributed or material others have shared.

*4. Minors.* If I sign for a participant under 18, I am their parent or legal guardian, and I give these permissions on their behalf and my own.

*5. Release.* I release the Homestead, its directors, officers and volunteers from claims arising from its use of Media under this release, including claims for invasion of privacy or right of publicity, to the extent permitted by law.

#signing[*6. General.* This release is governed by California law. If any part is held unenforceable, the rest remains in effect. It lasts until I withdraw it. I agree to sign electronically, and my electronic signature binds me as if written by hand. *I have read this release and had the chance to ask questions about it. I sign it voluntarily.*]
